<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>05 / 教师端</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>分层作业：三部分构成与四条差异化规则</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={200} viewBox='0 0 1140 200'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1140' height='58' rx='8' fill='#0E2340'/><text x='570.0' y='23.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>共同必做部分</text><text x='570.0' y='49.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>全班一致的基础任务</text><path d='M562 59 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='70' width='1140' height='58' rx='8' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='570.0' y='93.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>针对性练习</text><text x='570.0' y='119.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>按前置知识与步骤熟练度差异安排</text><path d='M562 129 l8 8 l-8 8' fill='none' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2'/><rect x='0' y='140' width='1140' height='58' rx='8' fill='#9FD0F5'/><text x='570.0' y='163.0' font-size='22' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>复习内容</text><text x='570.0' y='189.0' font-size='15' fill='#C8DCF2' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>针对前面不稳定的知识点，并安排新题验证</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>规则一</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>目标相同的学生可因前置知识、步骤熟练度不同而获不同题目或提示安排。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>规则二</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>前面知识点不稳定的学生加入复习题，并安排新题验证复习效果。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>规则三</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>知识准备充分但迁移不足时增加变式或方法比较，避免简单增加题量。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>规则四</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>历史记录不足时先安排适量诊断，不能仅凭缺少数据长期分配较低要求的作业。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：教师端设计思路.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 52 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>